[a11y] Added a "Skip to main content" bypass link to all base templates so that keyboard and screen reader users can jump past the navigation sidebar (WCAG 2.4.1).
[a11y] Added live regions so that messages appended via HTMX and pagination range changes are announced by screen readers.
[a11y] Added an accessible name and fallback content to rack elevations, which previously offered no text alternative to the embedded SVG.
